 {
  "subject": "You're in: your Sports Academi invite",
  "preview": "Your WhatsApp link is inside, plus how the group works.",
  "delay": 0,
  "html": "<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#F0EEE9\" style=\"background-color:#F0EEE9;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 12px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"480\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:480px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E4DFD6;border-radius:8px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 28px 4px;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/conor500/sports-forum-assets/main/email/academi/logo-academi-sports-v1.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Sports Academi\" style=\"display:block;width:150px;height:auto;border:0;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 28px;\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">WELCOME</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:900;color:#141414;letter-spacing:-0.5px;padding-top:8px;\">welcome to sports academi.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:14px;\">Hey {{ subscriber.first_name | default: \"there\" }},</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">Thanks for joining. Sports Academi is a free community for athletes, coaches and practitioners: people talking sport, careers and what it takes to go independent.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:18px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"border:2px solid #2B4BD8;border-radius:6px;\"><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/BKzWZgolWF00YniMUyg0I1\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;padding:13px 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#2B4BD8;text-decoration:none;\">Join the WhatsApp community &rarr;</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4DFD6;padding:24px 28px;\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">HOW THE GROUP WORKS</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#2B4BD8;padding:5px 0;\">01</td><td style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#141414;padding:5px 0;\"><strong>Announcements:</strong> new episodes, webinars and anything important. Only we post here.</td></tr><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#2B4BD8;padding:5px 0;\">02</td><td style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#141414;padding:5px 0;\"><strong>General chat:</strong> questions, wins, hot takes. Be useful, be kind.</td></tr><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#2B4BD8;padding:5px 0;\">03</td><td style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#141414;padding:5px 0;\"><strong>Webinars:</strong> links and replays for our free sessions every other Thursday.</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">No selling or spam in the group, please. If you want to share something you've made, ask first.</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4DFD6;padding:24px 28px;\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">ONE QUICK FAVOUR</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:900;color:#141414;padding-top:6px;\">reply and tell me what you're working on</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">Your sport, and the one thing you're working on right now. I read every reply.</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4DFD6;padding:22px 28px 26px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;\">Conor<br><span style=\"color:#8C867C;font-size:13px;\">Founder, Sports Academi</span></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#8C867C;padding-top:14px;\">Sports Academi &middot; a free community for athletes, coaches and practitioners</div></td></tr></table>"
 },
 {
  "subject": "Your biggest gap, and one thing to do this week",
  "preview": "The one change that moves your coaching business forward fastest.",
  "delay": 1,
  "html": "<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#F0EEE9\" style=\"background-color:#F0EEE9;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 12px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"480\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:480px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E4DFD6;border-radius:8px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 28px 4px;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/conor500/sports-forum-assets/main/email/academi/logo-academi-sports-v1.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Sports Academi\" style=\"display:block;width:150px;height:auto;border:0;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 28px;\">{% if subscriber.gap_tier != blank %}<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">YOUR GAP ANALYSIS</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:900;color:#141414;letter-spacing:-0.5px;padding-top:8px;\">{{ subscriber.gap_tier | downcase }}.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:14px;\">Hey {{ subscriber.first_name | default: \"there\" }}, you scored <strong style=\"color:#141414;\">{{ subscriber.gap_score }}%</strong>. Your biggest gap right now is <strong style=\"color:#141414;\">{{ subscriber.biggest_gap }}</strong>.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#8C867C;padding-top:18px;\">YOUR NEXT STEP</div>{% if subscriber.biggest_gap == \"Offer\" %}<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#141414;border-left:3px solid #2B4BD8;padding:2px 0 2px 12px;margin-top:10px;\">Package what you do into a named programme with a fixed price. This week: write your offer in one sentence and price it.</div>{% elsif subscriber.biggest_gap == \"Audience\" %}<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#141414;border-left:3px solid #2B4BD8;padding:2px 0 2px 12px;margin-top:10px;\">Your expertise needs to be seen. This week: post 3 times showing how you coach.</div>{% elsif subscriber.biggest_gap == \"Clients\" %}<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#141414;border-left:3px solid #2B4BD8;padding:2px 0 2px 12px;margin-top:10px;\">Word of mouth caps your growth. This week: start an email list or community you can reach directly.</div>{% elsif subscriber.biggest_gap == \"Systems\" %}<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#141414;border-left:3px solid #2B4BD8;padding:2px 0 2px 12px;margin-top:10px;\">Scattered tools eat your coaching time. This week: list every manual task and pick one to automate.</div>{% elsif subscriber.biggest_gap == \"Income\" %}<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#141414;border-left:3px solid #2B4BD8;padding:2px 0 2px 12px;margin-top:10px;\">Chasing payments costs you money. This week: move one client onto a recurring payment.</div>{% endif %}<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">Pick that one thing and do it this week. Small and done beats big and planned.</div>{% else %}<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">FIVE AREAS</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:900;color:#141414;letter-spacing:-0.5px;padding-top:8px;\">where coaching businesses get stuck.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:14px;\">Hey {{ subscriber.first_name | default: \"there\" }}, when athletes and coaches go independent, the same five gaps come up again and again:</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#2B4BD8;padding:5px 0;\">01</td><td style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#141414;padding:5px 0;\"><strong>Offer.</strong> Package what you do into a named programme with a fixed price.</td></tr><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#2B4BD8;padding:5px 0;\">02</td><td style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#141414;padding:5px 0;\"><strong>Audience.</strong> Your expertise needs to be seen.</td></tr><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#2B4BD8;padding:5px 0;\">03</td><td style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#141414;padding:5px 0;\"><strong>Clients.</strong> Word of mouth caps your growth.</td></tr><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#2B4BD8;padding:5px 0;\">04</td><td style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#141414;padding:5px 0;\"><strong>Systems.</strong> Scattered tools eat your coaching time.</td></tr><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#2B4BD8;padding:5px 0;\">05</td><td style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#141414;padding:5px 0;\"><strong>Income.</strong> Chasing payments costs you money.</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">Which one is yours? Hit reply and tell me. I read every reply.</div>{% endif %}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4DFD6;padding:24px 28px;\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">TALK IT THROUGH</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:900;color:#141414;padding-top:6px;\">bring it to the group</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">Post your biggest gap in the WhatsApp community. Someone in there has already solved it.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"border:2px solid #2B4BD8;border-radius:6px;\"><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/BKzWZgolWF00YniMUyg0I1\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;padding:13px 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#2B4BD8;text-decoration:none;\">Open the WhatsApp community &rarr;</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4DFD6;padding:22px 28px 26px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;\">Conor<br><span style=\"color:#8C867C;font-size:13px;\">Founder, Sports Academi</span></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#8C867C;padding-top:14px;\">Sports Academi &middot; a free community for athletes, coaches and practitioners</div></td></tr></table>"
 },
 {
  "subject": "What would you ask a pro who went independent?",
  "preview": "We're building The Arc around your questions.",
  "delay": 1,
  "html": "<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#F0EEE9\" style=\"background-color:#F0EEE9;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 12px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"480\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:480px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E4DFD6;border-radius:8px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 28px 4px;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/conor500/sports-forum-assets/main/email/academi/logo-academi-sports-v1.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Sports Academi\" style=\"display:block;width:150px;height:auto;border:0;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 28px;\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">THE ARC</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:900;color:#141414;letter-spacing:-0.5px;padding-top:8px;\">the arc is coming.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:14px;\">Hey {{ subscriber.first_name | default: \"there\" }},</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">We're launching The Arc, a podcast about the move from athlete to coach. Every episode is a conversation with someone who has made that jump, or who helps athletes make it: players turned coaches, physios, S&amp;C coaches, sports psychologists.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">We talk about the stuff nobody tells you: landing your first clients, what to charge, building a name while you're still playing, and the admin that eats your week.</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4DFD6;padding:24px 28px;\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">HELP US SHAPE IT</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:900;color:#141414;padding-top:6px;\">send us one question</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">If you could sit down with a pro who went independent, what would you ask them? Hit reply with one question. The best ones go straight to our guests, and we credit you on the episode.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">Members of the WhatsApp community hear about each episode first, the night before it goes public.</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4DFD6;padding:22px 28px 26px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;\">Conor<br><span style=\"color:#8C867C;font-size:13px;\">Founder, Sports Academi</span></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#8C867C;padding-top:14px;\">Sports Academi &middot; a free community for athletes, coaches and practitioners</div></td></tr></table>"
 },
 {
  "subject": "Say hello in the group (copy and paste this)",
  "preview": "A 30-second intro that gets you talking to the right people.",
  "delay": 1,
  "html": "<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#F0EEE9\" style=\"background-color:#F0EEE9;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 12px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"480\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:480px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E4DFD6;border-radius:8px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 28px 4px;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/conor500/sports-forum-assets/main/email/academi/logo-academi-sports-v1.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Sports Academi\" style=\"display:block;width:150px;height:auto;border:0;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 28px;\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">SAY HELLO</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:900;color:#141414;letter-spacing:-0.5px;padding-top:8px;\">say hello.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:14px;\">Hey {{ subscriber.first_name | default: \"there\" }},</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">The people who get the most out of Sports Academi are the ones who introduce themselves early. It takes 30 seconds. Copy this into the general chat and fill in the gaps:</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#141414;border-left:3px solid #2B4BD8;padding:2px 0 2px 12px;margin-top:14px;\">Hi all, I'm [name]. I [play / coach / work in] [sport]. Right now I'm working on [one thing]. I'd love to hear from anyone who has [one thing you want help with].</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"border:2px solid #2B4BD8;border-radius:6px;\"><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/BKzWZgolWF00YniMUyg0I1\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;padding:13px 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#2B4BD8;text-decoration:none;\">Open the WhatsApp community &rarr;</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4DFD6;padding:24px 28px;\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">FREE WEBINARS</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:900;color:#141414;padding-top:6px;\">every other thursday, 7pm</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">Every other Thursday at 7pm UK/Irish time, someone who has done it shares what they learned, live on Google Meet with Q&amp;A. They are free, and each one is announced in the Webinars group first.</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4DFD6;padding:22px 28px 26px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;\">See you in there,<br>Conor<br><span style=\"color:#8C867C;font-size:13px;\">Founder, Sports Academi</span></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#8C867C;padding-top:14px;\">Sports Academi &middot; a free community for athletes, coaches and practitioners</div></td></tr></table>"
 },
 {
  "subject": "Want to host your own Academi?",
  "preview": "We're building the place to run your coaching business. Early access is open.",
  "delay": 2,
  "html": "<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#F0EEE9\" style=\"background-color:#F0EEE9;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 12px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"480\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:480px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E4DFD6;border-radius:8px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 28px 4px;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/conor500/sports-forum-assets/main/email/academi/logo-academi-sports-v1.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Sports Academi\" style=\"display:block;width:150px;height:auto;border:0;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 28px;\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2B4BD8;\">COMING SOON</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:900;color:#141414;letter-spacing:-0.5px;padding-top:8px;\">host your own academi.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:14px;\">Hey {{ subscriber.first_name | default: \"there\" }},</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">We're building an app where you can host your own Academi, earn from what you know, and run your coaching, mentoring or consulting business in one place.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:10px;\">Your programmes, your clients, your check-ins and your payments, together instead of spread across messages, PDFs and spreadsheets.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:18px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"border:2px solid #2B4BD8;border-radius:6px;\"><a href=\"https://tally.so/r/2jEkpg?source=welcome-sequence\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;padding:13px 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#2B4BD8;text-decoration:none;\">Join the early waitlist &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;padding-top:12px;\">Early waitlist members get first access, and help shape what we build.</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4DFD6;padding:22px 28px 26px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3732;\">Conor<br><span style=\"color:#8C867C;font-size:13px;\">Founder, Sports Academi</span></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#8C867C;padding-top:14px;\">Sports Academi &middot; a free community for athletes, coaches and practitioners</div></td></tr></table>"
 }
]